---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/neelam-portrait.jpg';
import ResourceCards from '../components/ResourceCards.astro';
const faqs=[['Does my child need to know Hindi already?','No prior knowledge is needed to start a conversation about lessons. Tell Neelam what your child understands or speaks already so you can discuss an appropriate starting point. Age suitability and lesson format are confirmed individually.'],['Are these in-person classes?','Lessons are online with Neelam in India. The USA and Australia pages help families explore their local time zones; they do not describe physical schools or branches.'],['What are the lesson fees and available times?','Please enquire about fees, session length and current availability. The time-zone planner converts a proposed time, but does not reserve or promise a teaching slot.'],['Can we focus on speaking with grandparents?','Share that goal in your enquiry. Familiar greetings, family words and short questions can be a helpful place to begin. Our free family-phrases resource offers a small first step.']];
---
<Layout title="Online Hindi Classes for Families | Hindi with Neelam" description="A closer connection to Hindi for families in the USA and Australia. Explore online lessons, meet Neelam and try free beginner-friendly resources.">
<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">HINDI FOR LITTLE VOICES & BIG CONNECTIONS</p><h1>A little Hindi.<br/>A little closer<br/>to <em>home.</em></h1><p class="intro">Help your child find their voice in Hindi — and a new way to connect with the people, stories and everyday moments that matter.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Find your starting point <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet Neelam</a></div><ContactLinks/><p class="hero-note">Live online learning · Families in the USA & Australia</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="portrait-frame"><Image src={portrait} alt="Neelam smiling, wearing a pink sari" widths={[420,640,900]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 40vw" width={900} height={1200} format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="portrait-label"><div><strong>Meet Neelam</strong><span>Your teacher, on the other side of the screen.</span></div><a href="/about/" aria-label="Read about Neelam"><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="hello-stamp"><b lang="hi">नमस्ते</b><small>hello, connection.</small></div><span class="floating-word">a familiar voice ♡</span><svg class="flourish" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M48 95C53 65 35 38 29 9M48 95C63 67 70 43 87 20M47 81C29 74 18 62 16 49C35 51 45 64 47 81ZM57 65C59 44 68 34 84 31C81 48 71 60 57 65Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div></div></section>
<div class="feature-strip"><div class="shell strip-inner"><span>A real teacher, a personal connection</span><span>Speaking, reading & everyday Hindi</span><span>Learn from the comfort of home</span><span>A gentle place to begin</span></div></div>
<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EVERY LEARNER HAS A STARTING POINT</p><h2>Find your way into <em>Hindi.</em></h2></div><p>A first word. A reply to a grandparent. A story read together. Start with what matters to you.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="path-card"><span class="card-number">01 / LITTLE LEARNERS</span><span class="card-glyph" lang="hi" aria-hidden="true">क</span><h3>Curiosity comes first.</h3><p>Familiar words, playful practice and small steps into speaking Hindi.</p><a class="text-link" href="/hindi-for-kids/">Hindi for children <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article><article class="path-card"><span class="card-number">02 / HERITAGE LEARNERS</span><span class="card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h3>More than understanding.</h3><p>For the child who hears Hindi at home and is ready to find their own words.</p><a class="text-link" href="/heritage-hindi/">Connect through Hindi <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article><article class="path-card"><span class="card-number">03 / A FRESH START</span><span class="card-glyph" lang="hi" aria-hidden="true">आ</span><h3>Your first conversation.</h3><p>Introductions, useful questions and a little confidence for a new beginning.</p><a class="text-link" href="/hindi-for-beginners/">Hindi for beginners <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section warm-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DIFFERENT TIME ZONES. THE SAME CONNECTION.</p><h2>Across oceans.<br/>Around your <em>family.</em></h2></div><p>Online from India, with practical time-zone guidance for your part of the world.</p></div><div class="country-grid"><article class="country-card"><span class="region">FOR FAMILIES IN THE USA</span><span class="region-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>A weekend window<br/>to your roots.</h3><p>Explore a family-friendly starting point for Hindi and compare your city’s clock with India.</p><div class="city-tags"><span>New York & New Jersey</span><span>Chicago</span><span>Bay Area</span><span>Dallas–Fort Worth</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/usa/">Explore Hindi lessons in the USA <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article><article class="country-card"><span class="region">FOR FAMILIES IN AUSTRALIA</span><span class="region-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>A little Hindi<br/>after the school day.</h3><p>Find a routine for conversation, stories and reading, with a date-aware check of your local time.</p><div class="city-tags"><span>Melbourne</span><span>Sydney</span><span>Brisbane</span><span>Perth & more</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/australia/">Explore Hindi lessons in Australia <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article></div><p class="micro" style="margin:20px 0 0">Scheduling ideas, not confirmed appointments. Ask Neelam about current availability.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell teacher-section"><div class="teacher-photo"><Image src={portrait} alt="Neelam, the teacher behind Hindi with Neelam" width={600} height={800} format="webp" loading="lazy"/><div class="teacher-caption">A teacher. A listener. A familiar face.</div></div><div class="teacher-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE LESSONS</p><h2>A warm hello.<br/>An encouraging<br/><em>next step.</em></h2><p>Meet Neelam, the India-based teacher behind English with Neelam. This new space brings that personal connection to families exploring Hindi.</p><p>Start with a conversation about your learner — the Hindi they already know, the words they want to find, and the small moments you want to share.</p><div class="trust-pills"><span>B.Ed</span><span>M.Com</span><span>CTET Paper 1</span><span>Based in India</span></div><p class="micro">Teaching background listed on Neelam’s existing profile.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know Neelam <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section warm-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING TO START WITH</p><h2>Bring Hindi into <em>today.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Visit the learning corner <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div><ResourceCards/></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">IT’S NATURAL TO HAVE QUESTIONS</p><h2>Before we<br/>say <em>namaste.</em></h2><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem">A few things you might like to know.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask Neelam a question <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
</Layout>
